LIBRCEKUNIT - COMPLETE API REFERENCE
=====================================

Library for interacting with the "cekunit" admin panel backend.
Provides an HTTP client with automatic CSRF token handling,
cookie persistence, and full endpoint coverage.

Version: 2.1.0 (from Git)
License: AGPL-3.0
Repository: https://codeberg.org/mroczect/librcekunit


